Databasus. "Databasus" is used here only to identify the original project.

Modifications made to the Databasus image:
- Install the PGDG packages postgresql-<major>-address-standardizer and
  postgresql-<major>-postgis-tiger-geocoder where the upstream image lacks them.
- Add this LICENSE and NOTICE under /usr/share/doc/verification-postgres/.

Third-party software in the published images keeps its own license, including
PostgreSQL (PostgreSQL License) and PostGIS, the PostGIS tiger geocoder and the
address standardizer (GPL-2.0-or-later). Their copyright and license files are
shipped by the Debian packages under /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright.

